---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="pt-16 pb-16 lg:pt-32 lg:pb-32">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mr-auto ml-auto pr-6 pl-6">
            <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.82fr_1.18fr] lg:gap-20">
                <div class="lg:self-start">
                    <h2 class="lg:text-5xl text-4xl font-normal text-left text-white tracking-tight font-manrope mb-6" data-translate="choice.title">
                        Why Growing Companies Choose Garna
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-left text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="choice.description">
                        Growing teams need payroll software that won't collapse when things get busy and the team starts getting bigger
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="border-t border-white/10">
                    <article class="grid gap-5 border-b border-white/10 py-8 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
                        <div class="font-manrope text-sm font-semibold text-[#5EA500]">01</div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item1.title">...because your team is scaling</h3>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item1.description">
                                Garna is the solution for companies that are scaling up fast and need all those employees paid on time. It's for agencies, SaaS companies, and all sorts of distributed organisations who have people working all over the globe
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="grid gap-5 border-b border-white/10 py-8 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
                        <div class="font-manrope text-sm font-semibold text-[#5EA500]">02</div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item2.title">...because white-label infrastructure is your choice</h3>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item2.description">
                                Launch payroll services under your own brand or integrate payroll functionality directly into your product through API-first infrastructure and white-label capabilities
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="grid gap-5 border-b border-white/10 py-8 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
                        <div class="font-manrope text-sm font-semibold text-[#5EA500]">03</div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item3.title">...because you reduce admin work and payroll errors</h3>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item3.description">
                                Automation allows you to cut down on payroll errors and all that routine, manual work that influences your finance and HR team's efficiency
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="grid gap-5 border-b border-white/10 py-8 md:grid-cols-[3.5rem_minmax(0,1fr)]">
                        <div class="font-manrope text-sm font-semibold text-[#5EA500]">04</div>
                        <div>
                            <h3 class="text-2xl font-normal tracking-tight text-white font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item4.title">...because you prefer real-time visibility on every payroll operation</h3>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-base font-light leading-relaxed text-gray-400 font-manrope" data-translate="choice.item4.description">
                                If you need to keep track of payroll costs, make sure payments are going out on time, and keep an eye on all the reports and data, Garna has you covered with real-time visibility from a centralized dashboard
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </Section>
